<resources>
    <!--
      Copy hardcoded inside core:designsystem components. Only literals the component owns live
      here — anything a caller passes in (title, label, message) stays a plain String parameter.

      Apostrophes are written plainly (don't, you'll). Compose Resources does not unescape
      Android's \' so a backslash here would render on screen.
    -->

